message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Pekosz Lab Seasonal Influenza Nextstrain Builds"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow for reproducible genomic surveillance of seasonal
  influenza A/H1N1pdm, A/H3N2, and B/Victoria viruses detected through the
  Johns Hopkins Hospital Network. The pipeline performs BLAST-based segment
  typing and subtyping, database ingest, Nextclade clade assignment and
  quality control, filtering, and time-resolved phylogenetic inference with
  Augur, producing Auspice v2 datasets for all eight genome segments and a
  concatenated whole-genome build for each lineage.
